tions":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Tutti a parte mio marito","overview":"Un marito meraviglioso, due figlie perfette, un fiorente studio dentistico: tutto va bene per Iris (Laure Calamy). Ma da quanto tempo non fa l’amore? Dietro consiglio di una conoscente, la donna si iscrive a una app di dating… e scoperchia il vaso di Pandora! Appuntamento dopo appuntamento – tra buffi fraintendimenti, foto scabrose non richieste e una varietà impressionante di uomini pronti alle performance più bizzarre – Iris rientra in contatto con il suo corpo e la sua sensualità. Ma una volta trovata se stessa, si renderà conto, forse, di aver perso qualcosa per strada e dovrà fare di tutto per recuperarlo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"It's Raining Men","overview":"Iris has a seemingly flawless husband, two wonderful daughters, a dental practice with a relentless stream of customers, a nice apartment in an area she loves, friends who understand her... And she’ll soon be 50. And then a stranger plants a seed in her head: \"Take a lover\". Iris open Pandora’s box and candidates emerge as if from nowhere – as if it were raining men."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Iris répond \"Pas\", à l’ostéopathe quand il lui demande comment ça se passe avec son mari. Cet aveu échappe à Iris, il la surprend elle-même, il la bouleverse, comme une brutale prise de conscience : depuis combien de temps n’a-t-elle pas fait l’amour ? Pourtant, tout va bien : Iris a un mari qui semble n’avoir aucun défaut, deux filles formidables, un cabinet dentaire où les patients se succèdent sans temps mort, un bel appartement dans un quartier qu’elle adore, des amis qui lui ressemblent… Et bientôt 50 ans. C’est une inconnue qui lui souffle l’idée : \"Prenez un amant\". Iris ouvrira la boîte de Pandore et aussitôt, les hommes surgiront - comme s’il en pleuvait."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m74AOyw15XUlcadoYgNsgdb5doT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AgxTJfRmmJnU4bOypcdsROPgsxR.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1001079,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m74AOyw15XUlcadoYgNsgdb5doT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m74AOyw15XUlcadoYgNsgdb5doT.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m74AOyw15XUlcadoYgNsgdb5doT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m74AOyw15XUlcadoYgNsgdb5doT.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mHBE9taJJgQYcXlLFqwJ1yI3uV4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mHBE9taJJgQYcXlLFqwJ1yI3uV4.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gmCbG8SKCpaB5HrRDHbvjchsB5o.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gmCbG8SKCpaB5HrRDHbvjchsB5o.jpg","language":"en","width":1920,"height":2880},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gmCbG8SKCpaB5HrRDHbvjchsB5o.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gmCbG8SKCpaB5HrRDHbvjchsB5o.jpg","language":"en","width":1920,"height":2880},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ELq2WeIhm7svomGUP9aOfq9Moy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ELq2WeIhm7svomGUP9aOfq9Moy.jpg","language":"en","width":1324,"height":1986},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3CP07Bzx3vd2ZwUWBBChQHWnq1a.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3CP07Bzx3vd2ZwUWBBChQHWnq1a.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vzhtOjKDTQo9FPIUCFqtVYt0LcE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vzhtOjKDTQo9FPIUCFqtVYt0LcE.